Rapo
====

This product is a fork of the Rapo project and incorporates the rapo-ui
project. Both are MIT-licensed; this fork is distributed under the same terms
(see LICENSE).


Original work
-------------

Rapo - Revenue Assurance Processes Optimizer
    Author:     Timur Faradzhov <timurfaradzhov@gmail.com>
    Source:     https://github.com/t3eHawk/rapo
    Forked at:  v0.6.15 (commit 513906f, "Set version 0.6.15")
    License:    MIT

The fork inherits the substance of that project and keeps building on it:

    * the control engine and its run life cycle (rapo/core/)
    * the reconciliation algorithm and its SQL stages (rapo/algorithms/)
    * the control configuration model and the database schema (schema/)
    * the database and configuration layers (rapo/database.py, rapo/config.py)


Merged work
-----------

rapo-ui - Vue web interface for Rapo
    Author:     Kostadin Taneski
    Source:     https://github.com/krokce/rapo-ui
    License:    MIT

Merged into this repository as rapo-ui/ (source) and rapo/web/ui/ (the built
bundle the server serves), so that the backend and the interface are versioned
and released together.


Changes in this fork
--------------------

    Maintainer: Kostadin Taneski <kosta@taneski.com>
    Source:     https://github.com/krokce/rapo

Principally: the FastAPI web server and its documented API, live updates over
socket.io, the scheduler moved inside the server with a lease, an event history
and missed-fire handling, the run manager that gives every run its own process,
and per-run log files surfaced in the UI. The releases are described in
migrations/v0.7.0/README.md and migrations/v0.8.0/CHANGELOG.md.

Version numbers of this fork carry a local segment (for example 0.8.0+krokce.1)
so that they cannot be mistaken for releases of the original project, whose own
numbering continues independently.
